#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:40
msgid ""
"Resource checks cover actual pin/AF, controller, IRQ ceiling, shared "
"timer/timebase, physical DMA controller/stream, clock, exact memory domain, "
"mode and endpoint identity. A syntactically valid selector can still reject "
"because that provider does not implement the route. The resolver never "
"silently changes pins, modes or clock."
msgstr ""
"资源检查覆盖实际引脚／AF、控制器、IRQ 系统调用优先级阈值、共享定时器／时间基准、物理 DMA "
"控制器／流、时钟、准确内存域、模式及端点身份。即使选择项语法合法，仍可能因提供者未实现该路由而被拒绝。解析器绝不静默改变引脚、模式或时钟。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:45
msgid ""
"See the [configuration and ownership guide](../../guides/developer-"
"workflow.md) for Board-first queries, validated profiles, human summaries "
"and effective diffs. `explain` defaults to human-readable output; automation"
" must select `--json`."
msgstr ""
"[配置与所有权指南](../../guides/developer-workflow.md)说明从 Board 查询、经验证的 "
"profile、人读摘要及有效差异。`explain` 默认输出人读内容；自动化必须选择 `--json`。"

